Replaces: linux-image-6.1.176-rsrb (<< 6.1.176-2)
Breaks: linux-image-6.1.176-rsrb (<< 6.1.176-2)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Syntax-XXX/rs812-debian
Description: write RSRB kernels to the Synology RS812 SPI flash
 rsrb-flash-kernel writes an installed RSRB kernel to mtd1, verifies it by
 reading it back and never touches the bootloader (mtd0).
